        "title": "Highly recomend you avoid this place",
        "text": "In reviewing this temple it was highly recomended which must have been a local. Tourists I highly recomend you avoid this place. 1000 rps round trip, 1000 rps per person to get in. Told tour guides we didn't want one but, one said come here and we got thinking it was part of the high cost to get in. It was not he demanded 4000 rps. Then 1000 rps for two necklaces to get someone to go away. $80 us dollars for a terrible trip. There is nothing here for tourists it is only a cremation site for locals. From the smoke and cost we went straight back to our hotel room. Planned on make it a day seeing other sites in Kathmandu but this was sickening and disapointing. I didn't even come away with one picture. Once again, I highly recomend you avoid this place if you are a tourist. ",
